{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The agent-committer's sweep (its 5-minute timer; runnable by hand): runs agent.committer.sweep_repo for every repo enabled in runtime/agent/commit-repos.json and totals the results. Each repo's sweep commits EVERY dirty path git reports (store units, library-level files, deletions, generated sources, plain files), so a swept repo is clean and the next sweep makes zero LLM calls. One sweep at a time: a sweep that finds another still running returns busy without touching git or the LLM. Clean tree / git-less box / absent registry = free no-op. Takes NO params - timers fire with empty args. Returns {swept, commits, units_committed (= commits), pushed, llm_calls, results:[sweep_repo's result per repo]}.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse crate::agent::committer::sweep_repo::sweep_repo;","params":[],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"qjqlvj1a101918b6fx1a81","readers":[],"time":1794329352964,"username":"system","writers":[]}